This file gathers and re-exports the closing claim of Example 6.2 on eventually periodic trees: the basic development, the successor and concatenation laws for the subtree selector, the identification of the tree language with the selectors of positive root label, the identification of a subtree language with a left quotient, injectivity of the tree language, the equivalence of eventual periodicity with regularity, and the realization of every regular language by an eventually periodic tree.
